      "homepage": "https://docs.42crunch.com"
    },
    {
      "name": "8-habit-ai-dev",
      "description": "8-habit-ai-dev replaces ad-hoc AI prompting with a structured 7-step workflow: Research →\nRequirements → Design → Breakdown → Build Brief → Review → Deploy. Each step maps to one of\nStephen Covey's 8 Habits, providing both practical discipline and principled reasoning.\n\nKey features:\n- 17 hand-crafted skills with DAG-validated handoff chain\n- 472 automated assertions across 4 validator scripts (structure, skill-graph, content,\nverbosity)\n- Whole Person Model assessment (Body/Mind/Heart/Spirit scoring)\n- Maturity-adaptive verbosity via /calibrate (Dependence → Interdependence)\n- /reflect with dream-inspired lesson consolidation\n- /cross-verify 17-question checklist covering all 8 Habits\n- Composes cleanly with claude-governance plugin for compliance enforcement\n\nPure markdown plugin — no runtime dependencies, no MCP servers, no external services.",
