      "description": "SHIFT: Leadership Skills for the AI Era is a personalised AI leadership development agent. It does not teach generic leadership content. It becomes your leadership partner by learning who you are, what you do, and who you are becoming.\n\nWhen you install SHIFT, the first thing it does is learn your world: your role, your industry, your team, your biggest challenge, and your 12-month goal. From that point forward, every exercise, every reflection, every piece of development is specific to your life. A plumber running a crew of 6 gets different coaching than an HR director managing a call centre. Same skills. Different application. Because context changes everything.\n\nSHIFT builds 6 essential skills:\nS: Self-Management — regulating emotions, energy, and reactions under pressure\nH: Human Intelligence — reading people, adapting approach, building trust\nI: Innovation — questioning assumptions, taking initiative, proposing ideas\nF: Focus — prioritising ruthlessly, aligning effort to outcomes\nT: Thinking — independent reasoning, structured decisions, owning conclusions\nY: Your AI Edge — leading effectively in an AI-augmented workplace\n\nThe agent uses SHIFT Skill Signatures to tag every challenge you bring. Single codes (S, H, I, F, T) and compound codes (S+H, F+T, H+I, and 7 more) that reveal the real pattern behind your leadership challenges. Over time you start recognising your own patterns and thinking in SHIFT language.\n\nWhat you get:\n- Identity onboarding that personalises everything to your role and context\n- 25-question diagnostic with scored skill profiles and compound code analysis\n- 12-month development journey tied to your life and career goals\n- Weekly micro-practices tailored to your actual work (5 minutes per day)\n- Friday reflections with progress stats, improvement areas, and next-week focus\n- Real-time coaching on any leadership challenge using the SHIFT Coaching Lens\n- Personalised deliverables: energy maps, motivation maps, prioritisation matrices, decision journals, team discussion guides\n- Gmail/Calendar integration for weekly rhythm reminders\n\nThe first 2 weeks are free with full access. Week 3 onwards requires an access code from leadershipbydesign.co/shift-access.\n\nBuilt on 11 years of methodology from Leadership by Design. 4,000+ leaders developed across 30+ organisations and 25+ programmes.\n\nWhy use SHIFT instead of just asking AI about leadership? Raw AI gives you information. SHIFT gives you transformation. It knows your context, thinks in a proven system, tracks your development over time, produces deliverables you actually use, and builds a leadership operating system through daily practice that compounds over 12 months.",
