      "description": "Speak AI transcribes and analyzes your interviews, sales calls, research sessions, webinars, podcasts, and team meetings. This connector brings that library into your AI assistant — so instead of scrubbing hours of audio, you just ask.\n\nCapture\n- Meeting assistant — send a bot to your Zoom, Google Meet, or Microsoft Teams calls to record, transcribe, and analyze them. Schedule ahead, drop into a live call, or pull it out whenever.\n- Upload anything — audio, video, or text. Get a transcript and AI insights back in the same thread.\n- Async surveys — set up voice and video recorders with custom questions, share a link, and collect responses for research, candidate screens, customer feedback, or team check-ins.\n\nAnalyze\n- Multi-file analysis — search and reason across thousands of recordings at once. Group customer feedback by theme, compare answers across interviews, or pull every mention of a topic with citations back to the source.\n- AI chat with your library — ask follow-up questions, save favorite prompts, and keep a full chat history per recording or across your whole workspace.\n- Summarize and extract — decisions, action items, owners, risks, sentiment, themes, and exact quotes from any conversation.\n\nAct\n- Create — clips, highlights, captions, text notes, folders, custom fields, and embeds, directly from chat.\n- Multi-step workflows — chain actions together with automations and webhooks. Auto-tag new recordings, route insights to other tools, trigger follow-ups when a meeting ends, or run a custom prompt against every new upload.\n\nShare & Organize\n- Share — export answers, transcripts, captions, and clips. Generate embed links and shareable views to send insights to teammates or stakeholders without giving them access to your whole workspace.\n- Organize at scale — bulk move media, update transcripts and speakers, manage folders and views, and clone setups across teams.\n\nWho it's for: researchers, revenue and customer-suc