      "description": "Local or remote tmux agent dispatch — spawn, monitor, and recall long-running coding agents in dedicated tmux windows. Harness-emitted lifecycle signals (boot / turn_end / exit + activity-mtime) on the claude-family path; pane-diff heartbeat fallback for non-claude.",
      "category": "development",
